{"id":"9375de7089953a2b","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-borel.md","title":"Borel Set","display":"df-borel — Borel Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-borel","aliases":["58-df-borel"],"display":"df-borel — Borel Set","depends_on":["[[58-df-topology]]","[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","[[58-df-sigma-generated]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-borel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-borel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-borel — Borel Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a740bdad87b97ac6\" href=\"?note=a740bdad87b97ac6\" title=\"58-df-sigma-algebra\">58-df-sigma-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"58-df-sigma-generated\">58-df-sigma-generated</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\)</span> (topology predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"58-df-topology\">58-df-topology</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{O}(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\tau\">\\(\\mathcal{O}(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\tau\\)</span> (open-set family)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X(\\tau)\">\\(\\sigma_X(\\tau)\\)</span> (generated <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"58-df-sigma-generated\">58-df-sigma-generated</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{B}(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathcal{B}(X,\\tau)\\)</span> (Borel <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-algebra defined in this file)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Borel}(A,X,\\tau)\">\\(\\mathrm{Borel}(A,X,\\tau)\\)</span> (Borel-set predicate defined in this file)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel} \\vdash \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\to\\mathcal{B}(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\sigma_X(\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel} \\vdash \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\to\\mathcal{B}(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\sigma_X(\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Borel}(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land A\\in\\sigma_X(\\tau)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Borel}(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land A\\in\\sigma_X(\\tau)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{B}(X)\">\\(\\mathcal{B}(X)\\)</span> 是包含所有开集的最小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{O}(X) = \\tau\">\\(\\mathcal{O}(X) = \\tau\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的开集族即是拓扑 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span></li>\n<li>Borel 集是拓扑空间中由开集生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数的元素</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topology]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"a740bdad87b97ac6","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-generated","status":"resolved","id":"e03c77e7d23896d9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-sigma-generated]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topology","status":"resolved","id":"e7514bc4cefba4f2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)$ (topology predicate, see [[58-df-topology]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-sigma-generated","status":"resolved","id":"e03c77e7d23896d9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\sigma_X(\\tau)$ (generated $\\sigma$-algebra, see [[58-df-sigma-generated]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{O}(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma_X(\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{B}(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Borel}(A,X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel} \\vdash \\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\to\\mathcal{B}(X,\\tau)\\coloneqq\\sigma_X(\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}borel-set} \\vdash \\mathrm{Borel}(A,X,\\tau)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau,X)\\land A\\in\\sigma_X(\\tau)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal{B}(X)","displa